{
  "description": "The creature is a stout, quadrupedal animal shown in right-facing profile standing on a small patch of bare ground. It has a broad, blunt-snouted head with a large eye, a thick body with a pale creamy underbelly and a long tapering tail, and four sturdy limbs ending in clawed, five-toed feet. The dorsal surfaces of the head, back, sides, and upper tail are densely covered in overlapping dark gray-brown rounded scales, while six feathery, fringed external gills protrude from the side of the neck and the midline of the back behind the head. The overall coloration is muted gray-brown dorsally with a lighter yellowish-white throat, belly and underside of the tail.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, blunt and slightly flattened with a rounded snout, small nostril, slightly upturned mouth line, and a large prominent eye with a dark pupil and light iris and visible eyelid",
      "where": "at the front right end of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six feathery, stalked external gills with many fine filamentous fringes along the edges, dark gray with reddish-brown fringe tips",
      "where": "three larger ones clustered on the right side of the neck just behind the head, and three smaller ones in a row along the dorsal midline further back"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping rounded plate-like scales in dark gray-brown with lighter highlights, smaller and tighter on the top of the head, larger on the back, sides and upper tail, arranged in diagonal rows",
      "where": "covering the top of the head, the entire back and sides of the body, and the dorsal surface of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, muscular limbs with smooth gray skin, bent at the joints and splayed outward, contrasting with the scaly body",
      "where": "two forelimbs under the front chest and two hindlimbs under the rear body, supporting the body above the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad feet with five distinct digits each tipped with small dark claws, with wrinkled skin and splayed toes",
      "where": "at the distal ends of all four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering to a blunt point, scaly and dark on top and smooth pale cream underneath with faint transverse ridges",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the body to the right, lying just above the ground behind the hind legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "pale creamy-yellow to off-white coloration on the throat, chest, belly and underside of the tail, sharply contrasting with the dark scaly dorsum, with faint vertical striping on the belly",
      "where": "on the ventral side of the head, body and tail"
    }
  ],
